{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY AND LEARN: Fun Learning Games for Kids!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY AND LEARN brings <strong>four fun and educational games</strong> for preschool to 1st grade! Your child can play exciting mini-games, practice key skills, unlock secret characters, and learn while having a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO OUT NOW!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only left clicks are needed\u2014simple, intuitive, and perfect for young learners!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC MATCH</strong> \u2013 Explore colors and shapes with a magical wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP INTO LEARNING</strong> \u2013 Help a little frog learn the alphabet, phonics, and sight words in a fun adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATH-CASTERS</strong> \u2013 Practice numbers,  addition and subtraction while rising through the ranks of the League of Math!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVIEW AND RUN</strong> - Test your accumulated knowledge of each difficulty while running away from imminent danger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game includes practice pages to reinforce learning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Match:</strong> Learn colors and shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Into Learning:</strong> Master letters, numbers, and sight words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math-Casters:</strong> Addition and subtraction with a built-in calculator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Review and Run does not have a practice mode since it takes the subjects from all the other games!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat challenges, reach new levels, and unlock fun characters in each game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 original tracks</strong> composed with <strong>Sentient Pulse</strong>, playable in the music menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Learning Combined!</strong><br>PLAY AND LEARN makes early education exciting, engaging, and magical. Perfect for kids and stress-free for parents!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to fun learning!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/f39cdc16bb98b45f5d7a87dd979842e4c3df86e3.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Match - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/e095562817b76f4ec46be709018b4cd292ffa9b6.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Match - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/7727534bbe8ffe505c0adefe4abe16b298885948.jpg"},{"name":"Leap Into Learning - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/5a0112cb759170bbaf07bfdc356676b5adaa341b.jpg"},{"name":"Leap Into Learning - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/3561342f152c0e2d6ce5d9524f819ba902617384.jpg"},{"name":"Math-Casters - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/93aa5583881c41edd6381d6134a2092529930427.jpg"},{"name":"Math-Casters - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/bbc0b82425630a37aec5d203c03a0881dcd5a241.jpg"},{"name":"Review and Run - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/47ba2c44f29b2dd1e8f4991680eb5f8e9fce9669.jpg"},{"name":"Review and Run - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/82b1f312717d3cea46c17e2ec84627486de54787.jpg"},{"name":"PLAY AND LEARN: MASTERED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc